  "description": "A model of quantum computing technology development, capturing qubit counts, error rates, algorithm development, and commercial adoption. Based on quantum computing roadmaps and progress metrics. Reference: Based on system dynamics methodology (Sterman, 2000; Forrester, 1961). Source: https://systemdynamics.org/",
  "source": "https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-019-1666-5",
  "reference": "Arute F, et al. Quantum supremacy using a programmable superconducting processor. Nature. 2019;574:505-510. See also IBM Quantum Roadmap.",
